  cashier
  warehouse
  service
  technician
  courier
  marketer
  admin
  owner
  // Retired 2026-07-20 by owner decision: the role had no UI, no tests and no
  // per-point data isolation, so `store_operations:read` exposed the whole
  // network. All grants are removed and it is no longer offered when creating an
  // account. The enum value stays because Postgres cannot drop one in place —
  // dropping it needs a type recreation, and no row has ever used it.
  franchise
}

